      "raw": "<p>So we were playing last night and one hero was &quot;The Greatest Legacy&quot; whose power reads, &quot;1 Hero regains 1 HP and may use a power now&quot;</p><p>This person used this power on Legacy who used this power on Legacy and so on until Legacy was back to full HP. &nbsp;Every turn Legacy would return to full HP and when he played the card that redirected all damage to Legacy the game was over.</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">This is clearly not the intent of the card. &nbsp;Should it be &quot;1 OTHER Hero regains 1 HP and may use a power now&quot; or can Legacy use it on himself once?</span></p>",
